WEBVTT

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.720
Rina-chan!

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.670
Wait, Rina-chan!

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.860
Wait!

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.380
Let's talk about it a little more!

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.310
I'll try and convince Ogata-san...

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.780
Wait, please, Rina-chan!

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:39.710
If you were to quit, Rina-chan, I'd...

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.480
It's my fault...

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.220
It's not your fault.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.500
Sorry.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.760
I've already decided.

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:03.660
No, Rina-chan!

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.800
I don't want you to go!

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.110
Don't go...

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:23.820
Don't quit...

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:29.760
I'll quit instead!

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:31.940
I won't be an idol anymore...

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.050
I don't care if I don't become a singer...

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.770
So Rina-chan...

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:36.730
Please!

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:54.710
You dummy.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.360
I'm out-

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:07.230
nemuri nasai ima wa tada

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:07.230
Sleep, for now

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:14.130
watashi no naka de doko ni mo ikanai de

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:14.130
Inside of me, and don't go anywhere

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:35.120
madoromi no fuchi de yureteru gunjou iro no yo

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:35.120
Through the slumbering ultramarine sky

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:40.660
majiwaru koto no nai hoshi wo sagashiteru

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:40.660
I am searching for stars that will never cross

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:48.370
anata wo motomeru yubisaki yami ni samayotte

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:48.370
These fingertips search for you, but are lost in darkness

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:57.240
mogaite mo nukedesenai ai no umi ni oboreteku

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:57.240
I try but I can't escape, and I drown in the sea of love

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:05.120
yawaranai toiki ni kokoro sae mo furueru

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:05.120
Your tender sigh makes my heart tremble

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:10.740
karamaru utsukushi kumo no ito no you

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:10.740
Seemingly entangled in the beautiful strands of a spider web

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:15.230
ugokenai no watashi wo yurushite

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:15.230
I cannot move, please forgive me

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.530
anata no ude ni dakarete nemuru

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.530
I am sleeping with your arms around me

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.790
nani mo kamo sutetatte ii

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.790
I don't mind losing anything else

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:29.300
ii kono mama no maboroshi nante zukuru no wa yamete

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:29.300
Stop pretending that you are a good girl

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:32.780
hontou no watashi wo mitsukete

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:32.780
Find the real me

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:38.850
zutto matteru

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:38.850
I'll be waiting forever

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.800
This is Shinozuka.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:51.440
Page 17
There are lies one wants 
to be exposed. There are also truths
one does not want to believe in.
In my case, there is one of each.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.890
I am calling you, as promised.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.030
I don't think you two will be able to meet for the rest of January.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.780
Maybe it's better if I don't call...

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.550
It is.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.280
Do you still remember that time?

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.060
The last day of recording "White Album".

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.560
You had come to support me...

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.350
I have a favor to ask of you, Yuki.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:54.470
One of the songs in this album includes guest vocals,

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:58.210
but there's no one who would fit the image, so...

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.660
Would you like to try with me?

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:06.200
Rina-chan... singing together with me...

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.020
If it's you, it'll be perfect.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.150
But, I...

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:13.220
Also, you're the last one to be recorded for today.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.640
You'll give us all a hard time if you delay things like that.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.500
Let's make your next shot the decisive one!

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.950
It was fun,

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.980
being in the same studio as you.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.210
It wasn't fun for me!

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.390
I was trying so hard.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.310
Seeing you try so hard,

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.840
made me wonder if I was like that in the beginning.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.610
That's impossible...

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:49.640
Rina will perform at Club Calma on Christmas Eve - Just 1300 standing spots! - Fall of the Idol Queen

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.580
Touya

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.780
At the time,

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.550
if you hadn't been there for me,

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:14.830
perhaps White Album wouldn't have been completed.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:19.290
No, even with the concert, if it was just me performing,

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:20.750
I wonder what might've happened.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.650
Yuki...

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:25.940
To be able to sing together with Rina-chan,

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:30.580
and to have it preserved forever in my records...

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.720
That's why I worked so hard.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.540
I see.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.120
Thank you, Yuki.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:43.280
I know, I understand.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:47.220
For Ogata-san to have a rookie like me perform on same stage as Rina-chan...

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:48.780
He can't allow that, am I right?

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:50.590
No, it's not like that-

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.920
You can tell me anything.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.740
If it's about Ogata-san's plans,

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.590
changing the way he does things might be impossible...

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:59.840
But if there's something bad, or something that isn't good enough,

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:02.260
I'll be the scapegoat. As long as you tell me,

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:03.720
I'll try my best to fix things!

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:06.210
No, it's not your fault.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:07.960
This is all for my sake.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.860
That can't be...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.470
I'm serious!

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:13.220
Fujii-kun, too.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.510
When he was still one of my staff,

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:17.430
he told me so.

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:19.710
Yes.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:22.370
I have to change, too.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.420
I can't go on like this.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.800
I don't want to stand still in one place.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.920
That's why I'm starting by changing my surroundings, my environment...

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:35.660
Look, it's just like when you clear
your desk when it's time for a test...

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:36.870
That sort of thing.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.220
But, the album...

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.810
What about the album, Rina-chan?

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.960
I'm about to change my recording company,

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:44.870
so I'm afraid...

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.010
I'm sorry I lied to you.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.320
No...

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:53.810
In that case, how about I invite you as a special guest artist in my album-

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:57.080
Really, so your album is progressing well...

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:57.880
Congratulations.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:02.450
No, it's just something Ogata-san casually said.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.410
I don't quite feel confident enough at this point...

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.950
If I were to do it myself I don't think I could put my spirit into it.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:10.080
So, Rina-chan...

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.090
Please help me.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:12.510
Don't rely on others so much.

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:17.460
This won't do.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:20.000
You will produce a album with only you in it, Yuki.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:21.770
Yes.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:27.170
Ah, before I forget, I'd like to thank you about the letter.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:31.830
You also gave him free time to...

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:35.560
Was Fujii-kun able to go to the concert?

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:38.340
It was you who gave him the letter, right?

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.850
Yeah, Yayoi-san asked me to...

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:43.830
I wonder if Yayoi-san was busy...

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.930
She wouldn't have had much time leading up to the concert.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:51.470
Also, Fujii-kun and I met everyday from time to time, so...

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:55.420
I intended to spare some time to give him the letter myself,

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:58.920
but Yayoi-san said she was going to Echoes, so...

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:01.290
Is... that so?

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:04.040
She also drives Fujii-kun around from time to time.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:05.960
Oh, really?

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:08.490
Looks like it.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.020
Okay.

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:14.100
I'll give her my thanks, too.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.780
I'm hungry, so let's eat.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:23.800
Yuki?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.620
Rina-chan...

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.610
So... you really can't?

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:34.020
I can't.

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:07.300
I'm sorry.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.740
Echoes Cafe

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.740
Aesop?

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.520
She's talking about Touya.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.570
Yes, I'm Aesop's senpai.

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:28.910
And she's my girlfriend.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:34.800
Looks like everything up until now is true, then.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:38.450
Then what about Aesop going out with Morikawa Yuki?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.140
It's the truth.

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:43.050
Ahh!

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:45.480
So his hands reach that far, huh?

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:49.230
So, now that we're talking about the real girlfriend Yuki,

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:51.540
it doesn't look like they're the same age.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.680
She covers it up with makeup,

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.090
but you can tell from her skin.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:57.380
No matter how you look at it, she looks 24, or 25,

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:00.290
or maybe she's even over 30.

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:02.250
Who... are you talking about?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.910
Sounds like she's talking about Yuki's manager.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.250
Manag-

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.270
Hey, even if it's you, Haruka-chi, I'll still get mad!

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.140
You keep pretending to be ignorant-

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:15.120
No way, she's angry?

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:40.620
So that's how it was.

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:43.930
Hey, about your brother, Haruka-chi...

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:45.930
Why did he die?

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.310
Traffic accident.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.360
Oh, really?

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:55.200
I thought he ran to catch a ridiculous ball that you hit,

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.130
and fell off a cliff, or something.

00:11:57.390 --> 00:11:58.220
Wai-

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.460
My brother isn't that dumb.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.800
I guess so!

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.770
He's not Aesop, after all!

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.490
Why do you keep making fun of Touya?

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:13.220
I mean, he does do stupid things once in a while,

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:16.710
but he's taking his job as your tutor seriously, isn't he?

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:21.920
Touya, in his own way, tries so hard to care for you, Mana-chan...

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:25.720
I know. I know, but...

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:29.350
The way he does things just keeps missing the mark...

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:32.040
It's so frustrating...

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:35.020
How can a man who doesn't understand a woman's heart like that even exist?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:39.440
I'm not sure I wanted you to tell me that, Mana-chan.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:41.990
By a Zashiki Warashi?

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:43.530
Yes, yes.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:47.100
Anyway, how come I'm the Zashiki Warashi now?

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.510
Because you suddenly appear, then disappear.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.840
To be in so much pain...

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:54.250
... you'll always be the one who's more horrible, Haruka-chi!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.860
Then, how come Touya's Aesop?

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:57.950
That's because,

00:12:57.950 --> 00:12:59.800
a long time ago, in a land far, far away,

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:04.260
Aesop, who was honest to the point of being stupid, lived all by himself and was lonely-

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.220
So it was only lent to you?

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:10.330
That's right.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:13.040
We found the contract from when we first obtained the painting,

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.900
and that's what was written.

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.180
And?

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:19.970
I didn't know that the painting didn't belong to me.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:22.150
Then who does it belong to?

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.520
It belongs to a high-ranking individual in a certain corporation...

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.350
I can't say the name.

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.060
That was the agreement.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.990
So it's only now that you regret it?

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:34.470
Regret? Like I said, that's what the contract says-

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:38.780
I'm... extremely sorry for this.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:39.870
And so you want me to return it.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:43.540
We have come here precisely to ask you to return it.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:46.280
Otherwise, we'll have to buy it from them.

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:47.050
It's too late.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.150
Listen, Ei-chan.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.650
The painting has been transferred to me through proper legal procedures.

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:52.950
All rights belong to-

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.100
In other words, this is the current situation.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:14:00.670
This has now become your problem, Ogata-san.

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.870
Since all rights belong to you,

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:06.950
in a sense, this painting is no longer any of our business.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:07.990
It's too late.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.840
Wait, the contract doesn't matter.

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:15.760
The relationship between us cannot be measured by that single piece of scrap paper, right?

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:18.080
Even so, it's too late.

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:21.130
This is not a problem that can be solved by feigning ignorance.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.980
It is my responsibility.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.220
If you're unwilling to return it, then I can only buy it from them.

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:30.850
This I understand, but right now our company simply cannot afford to borrow money to pay for it.

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:31.800
It's too late.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.490
Please, Ei-chan.

00:14:33.490 --> 00:14:38.890
Well? This is the price as is printed in the contract.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.900
The other party is rushing us.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.150
I'm sorry.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.680
I have no intention to part with the painting.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.770
I want very much to pay for the painting.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.630
But it's too late.

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:57.240
Hey, Ei-chan.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.920
You have a studio, don't you?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.700
Ah, if that's okay with you,

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.890
feel free to take it.

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:07.910
But it still wouldn't be enough, would it?

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.870
Eh? I guess you're right...

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:16.810
See if you can use what's remaining to hold them off for now.

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:22.410
That kind of child's play almost made my heart burst.

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.370
But, he fell for it.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:29.850
Furthermore, wasn't it you, Itsuki-san, who said that rock stars are immature?

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:31.510
Refer to me as "President".

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:38.140
Then, what should we do if he decides to return the painting?

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:43.250
Then we'll have to cry and beg on our knees.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.290
Am I right, President?

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.600
He really wants that painting.

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.590
I have absolutely no idea what's so good about it.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:53.960
Whatever. The end result's all right.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:57.880
Is that so? Are you sure you won't be disappointed?

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.960
Since it's something you want even though it's not worth anything.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.260
What are you saying?

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:03.060
We're a company that produces artists.

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:07.640
Since we've already come this far, don't you feel like trying just a little harder?

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:10.250
What would you say to your husband-

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:10.930
Shut up!

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:26.130
It's... too late.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:30.610
FAKE

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:51.510
Are you sure it's okay if we take this?

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.980
Sure. How about taking the sound engineer too?

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.850
I don't need him now.

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:03.710
That girl... not only performs,
but also records her songs, all by herself.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:04.790
Oh?

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.510
Is she her assistant?

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.500
She was with her when she came.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:23.640
I suppose you could describe her as Menou's favorite doll.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:27.840
Like how kids can't sleep without them, that kind of thing.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:32.810
When Menou doesn't have that girl beside her,

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:35.380
she's unable to write or sing a single song,

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:36.930
or maybe even live.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.170
Ah, Menou-san!

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:54.850
Menou-san, please wait!

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:58.870
Everything should be fine this time.

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:01.290
Protecting the agricultural industry...
Government subsidizes...

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:18.810
A coffee, please.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.810
How's Fujii-san today?

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:33.400
She likes Cheesecake,

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:36.280
And she dislikes ridged colored pencils, the same as me!

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:38.490
Number six tonight on the charts, Miss Morikawa Yuki,

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:39.640
White Album!

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:52.890
Surechigau mainichi ga fuete yuku keredo

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:52.890
<i>Though the number of days we miss each other is growing,</i>

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:52.890
すれ違う毎日が　増えてゆくけれど

00:18:53.970 --> 00:19:02.770
Otagai no kimochi wa itsumo soba ni iruyo

00:18:53.970 --> 00:19:02.770
<i>The feelings we have for each other are just by our sides.</i>

00:18:53.970 --> 00:19:02.770
お互いの気持ちはいつも　側にいるよ

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.770
Why is Yuki-san crying?

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:45.380
Isn't she just overwhelmed with happiness?

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.460
Probably put too much of her feelings in.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:48.890
It's just like Yuki to do that.

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:51.080
Are your eyes simply two useless holes?

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.150
Yuki-san is sad.

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.880
How do you know, father?

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.320
I know

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:02.820
She has nothing to be sad about.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.260
Yuki is also troubled

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:13.420
But

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.240
Only good things happen to Yuki now.

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:13.420
it's not my fault

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:22.890
I can't

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.860
By the way, did you come here to keep me company,

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:23.560
do anything for her

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.100
or did you come here to study?

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.640
I'm not studying, I'm working.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:29.770
The kid I tutor for is about to have her entrance exams,

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.850
so I'm making her a mock exam.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:36.630
My my, you've become someone who can teach others.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.590
All you used to do was play with girls...

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:43.050
You'd get bullied and you'd cry like a bird.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.130
Do you remember?

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:46.970
I don't remember.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.930
I'm disturbing your work, aren't I?

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:52.470
I guess I'll go home and do it.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:53.150
Yes?

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:56.740
Fujii-san, it's time to turn off the lights.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:58.720
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:01.770
I'm going to the bathroom. You should sleep.

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:16.760
Number One - Ogata Rina

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:30.040
Well then, we'll stop here for today.

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:31.840
Today's also-

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:33.460
-a case of "oversupply"!

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:35.020
Are you an idiot?!

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:38.140
Mana-chan, aren't you going cycling today?

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:44.520
It's about time that you don't want to do that anymore, right?

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:46.850
Haruka-chi's jealous.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:50.790
Because I went to Aesop's house on Christmas Eve.

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:55.430
I didn't want to go in, but I was forced to.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:57.740
How annoying!

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:00.070
Haruka's jealous?

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:14.400
Are you an idiot?!

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:17.810
So, the preparations are complete.

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:21.320
In that case, from the conference room of Touou Hotel,

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:25.700
we'll broadcast the interview concerning Ogata Rina's transfer.

00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:28.700
Transfer? Did she just say transfer?

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:39.980
Transfer?

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:56.140
watashi ni itsumo anata wa yasashii

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:56.140
You have always been kind to me

00:22:57.060 --> 00:23:02.730
sono yasashisa ga fuan ni suru

00:22:57.060 --> 00:23:02.730
But this kindness makes me insecure

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:11.550
unmei no ito hodokenai you ni

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:11.550
This string of fate, I'll retie it over and over

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:18.170
nando mo musubi naoshite

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:18.170
So that it will never come loose

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:26.550
tsugi ni au yakusoku dekinai mama

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:26.550
I don't want to hear you say goodbye

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:36.490
wakare no kotoba mada kikitaku wa nai yo

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:36.490
Until we make promises to meet again

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:44.230
aenai yoru ni yume de aetara

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:44.230
Even if we can't meet tonight, 
if I can see you in my dreams

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:52.140
ashita ga tsurakute mo waratte irareru

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:52.140
Even if tomorrow is difficult I'll be able to smile

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:59.600
donna ni tooku hanarete ite mo

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:59.600
No matter how far apart we may become

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:09.570
tsunagatte ireru to shinjite iru

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:09.570
I believe that we will still be connected together

00:24:21.800 --> 00:24:23.150
Page 18

00:24:24.130 --> 00:24:25.960
Bugs have it too good, don't they?

00:24:26.170 --> 00:24:27.960
They shut themselves inside their shells,

00:24:27.960 --> 00:24:29.950
Yet they're still claustrophobic.

00:24:30.430 --> 00:24:31.900
White Album.
